# Simulacrum Synthesizer: "When this artifact enters, scry 2" (turn 1: both cards kept on top, Blasting Station first), "Whenever another
# artifact you control with mana value 3 or greater enters, create a Construct". In turn 1 nothing but the scry happens although four
# Moxen (mana value 0) enter beside it and the Synthesizer itself is an artifact of mana value 3 ("another"). In turn 2 Bot2 casts Blasting Station
# (mana value 3) with Black Lotus: an opponent's artifact does not trigger it. In turn 3 Bot1's Blasting Station does: one Construct, a
# 0/0 that gets +1/+1 for each artifact Bot1 controls (the five Moxen, the Synthesizer, the Station and itself: 8/8). In turn 5 Cranial Plating
# (mana value 2) enters and makes no second Construct, only a 9/9 Construct (one more artifact).

